  "notes": [
    "FC03 or FC04 read (the same values), FC06 writes one register; at most 18 registers per read.",
    "32-bit values are low word first (bytes high first in each word).",
    "Which variables exist depends on the measuring system (0x1002) and on SUM (0x1007); see table 2.3-1 of the protocol.",
    "Firmware from r.d0 unless a register says otherwise."
  ],
